### Stage F8 - Testing Validation Fixes
### Prerequisites: 
### 1. Backend running on http://localhost:5256
### 2. Have a completed, paid booking (use test_b1_reset_completion.sql to reset if needed)
### 3. Login as participant1 first to get auth cookie

###
### Step 1: Login as participant1
POST http://localhost:5256/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "EmailOrUsername": "participant1",
  "password": "pass"
}

###
### Step 2: Get booking IDs (find a Paid booking with CompletedAtUtc set)
GET http://localhost:5256/api/bookings/

###
### TEST 1: Valid Review Creation (should succeed)
### Replace {bookingId} and {tourId} with actual values from Step 2
POST http://localhost:5256/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "08de4970-dacf-4ee8-8982-ca731d5563e3",
  "targetType": 0,
  "targetId": "08de4970-dace-4766-82de-9c45f852e727",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Great tour experience!"
}

###
### TEST 2: Duplicate Review (should return 409 Conflict)
### Use same bookingId and targetId as TEST 1
POST http://localhost:5256/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "PUT_SAME_BOOKING_ID_HERE",
  "targetType": 0,
  "targetId": "PUT_SAME_TOUR_ID_HERE",
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Trying to review again"
}

###
### TEST 3: Comment Too Long (should return 400 BadRequest with message "Comment must be 2000 characters or less")
POST http://localhost:5256/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "08de4970-dacf-4ee8-8982-ca731d5563e3",
  "targetType": 1,
  "targetId": "08de4970-dace-4f4c-877a-707c433c1eb0",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": ""
}

###
### TEST 4: Invalid Rating (should return 400 BadRequest with message "Rating must be between 1 and 5")
POST http://localhost:5256/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "08de4970-dacf-4ee8-8982-ca731d5563e3",
  "targetType": 0,
  "targetId": "08de4970-dace-4766-82de-9c45f852e727",
  "rating": 6,
  "comment": "Invalid rating test"
}

###
### TEST 5: Get a review ID for reply testing
### Replace {reviewId} with actual review ID from successful creation
GET http://localhost:5256/api/reviews/{reviewId}

###
### TEST 6: Login as motard (to test reply as review target)
POST http://localhost:5256/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "EmailOrUsername": "organizer1",
  "password": "pass"
}

###
### TEST 7: Valid Reply (should succeed)
### Replace {reviewId} with actual review ID
POST http://localhost:5256/api/reviews/{reviewId}/replies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Thank you for your feedback!"
}

###
### TEST 8: Empty Reply Message (should return 400 BadRequest with message "Reply message cannot be empty")
POST http://localhost:5256/api/reviews/08de4972-044f-4794-8e26-967ad2e2d746/replies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": ""
}

###
### TEST 9: Reply Message Too Long (should return 400 BadRequest with message "Reply message must be 2000 characters or less")
POST http://localhost:5256/api/reviews/08de4972-044f-4794-8e26-967ad2e2d746/replies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": ""
}

###
### Summary of Expected Results:
### TEST 1: 201 Created - Review created successfully
### TEST 2: 409 Conflict - "You have already reviewed this target for this booking"
### TEST 3: 400 BadRequest - "Comment must be 2000 characters or less"
### TEST 4: 400 BadRequest - "Rating must be between 1 and 5"
### TEST 7: 200 OK - Reply added successfully
### TEST 8: 400 BadRequest - "Reply message cannot be empty"
### TEST 9: 400 BadRequest - "Reply message must be 2000 characters or less"
